codex
The high-half defect is confirmed, and `rlwnm` has the same mask and final-AND semantics. Widening the decoder’s mask alone would not fix it: both handlers explicitly narrow the mask and result to 32 bits.

The permitted source file does not define `ppc_instr_call`, `reg`, the mode types, or `update_cr0`. I can trace their uses here, but cannot verify those declarations within the file restriction.
